        <mxCell id="notes" parent="1" style="rounded=1;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontSize=16;fontColor=#163c35;fillColor=#f0f6f4;strokeColor=#b9d6d0;" value="Grain: one row per (OrderID, ProductKey); UNIQUE(OrderID, ProductKey).&#xa;ItemAmount = Quantity x UnitPrice. Historical price comes from order_items.unit_price.&#xa;All order items are loaded, including cancelled orders. For completed sales, filter OrderStatus = delivered.&#xa;Count orders using COUNT(DISTINCT OrderID), not the number of item rows.&#xa;Delivery fees are excluded here to avoid repeating a fee for every product.&#xa;&#xa;SHARED MODEL / 3 FACT TABLES + 7 DISTINCT DIMENSIONS&#xa;Repeated dimensions across pages are the same physical tables; attributes use Type 1 updates (no SCD history).&#xa;OrderDateKey -&gt; DimDate.DateKey; all other FK names match the dimension PK names. All FK columns are NOT NULL.&#xa;DateKey = YYYYMMDD from the order timestamp in Europe/Sofia. Other dimension keys are warehouse surrogate keys.&#xa;[0..1] = nullable attribute; all unmarked columns are NOT NULL. PK = primary key; UQ = unique; FK = foreign key.&#xa;Load scope: orders.notes LIKE SAMPLE-2026-%, including related payments/deliveries. Exclude the demo order.&#xa;Never join raw fact tables by OrderID for aggregation: aggregate each fact to the desired level first." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="405" width="1480" x="60" y="1000" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
