        <mxCell id="notes" value="Grain: one row per source payment record; PaymentID is UNIQUE.&#xa;SuccessfulAmount = Amount when PaymentStatus = successful; otherwise 0.&#xa;SUM(Amount) includes failed attempts: use SUM(SuccessfulAmount) for collected money.&#xa;Collected money includes delivery fees and must not be added to item sales (the same money is represented twice).&#xa;OrderDateKey groups payments by order date. For actual payment dates, use PaidAt in Europe/Sofia.&#xa;&#xa;SHARED MODEL / 3 FACT TABLES + 7 DISTINCT DIMENSIONS&#xa;Repeated dimensions across pages are the same physical tables; attributes use Type 1 updates (no SCD history).&#xa;OrderDateKey -&gt; DimDate.DateKey; all other FK names match the dimension PK names. All FK columns are NOT NULL.&#xa;DateKey = YYYYMMDD from the order timestamp in Europe/Sofia. Other dimension keys are warehouse surrogate keys.&#xa;[0..1] = nullable attribute; all unmarked columns are NOT NULL. PK = primary key; UQ = unique; FK = foreign key.&#xa;Load scope: orders.notes LIKE SAMPLE-2026-%, including related payments/deliveries. Exclude the demo order.&#xa;Never join raw fact tables by OrderID for aggregation: aggregate each fact to the desired level first." style="rounded=1;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontSize=16;fontColor=#163c35;fillColor=#f0f6f4;strokeColor=#b9d6d0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="1000" width="1480" height="405" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
